@PoWatch.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:80

### ─── Health ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{PoWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### ─── Sessions & ingest ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dev: FakeAuth accepts any X-Fake-User.

POST {{PoWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sessions
X-Fake-User: dev
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timeZoneId": "UTC" }

###

GET {{PoWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sessions
X-Fake-User: dev

###

### ─── Stats, recaps, trophies ───────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{PoWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stats/presence?range=today
X-Fake-User: dev

###

GET {{PoWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recaps/day/2026-09-25?tz=UTC
X-Fake-User: dev

###

GET {{PoWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/achievements
X-Fake-User: dev

###

GET {{PoWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/regulars
X-Fake-User: dev

###

### ─── Diagnostics ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Get masked system health snapshot (CPU, memory, storage status, masked credentials)
GET {{PoWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/diagnostics/status
Accept: application/json

###

### ─── OpenAPI / Scalar ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OpenAPI spec JSON
GET {{PoWatch.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###
